@startuml CU-05
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (registro / perfil)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /auth, /clients" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» AuthService / ClientService / User" as Model

Cli -> UI : 1: registrarse
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /auth/register
Ctrl -> Model : 3: register_client(db, data)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: ClientProfileRead
Ctrl --> UI : 5: TokenResponse (JWT)
UI --> Cli : 6: sesión iniciada

Cli -> UI : 7: consultar perfil
UI -> Ctrl : 8: GET /clients/me
Ctrl -> Model : 9: get_client(db, user_id)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: ClientProfileRead
Ctrl --> UI : 11: ClientProfileRead
UI --> Cli : 12: perfil mostrado

Cli -> UI : 13: editar perfil
UI -> Ctrl : 14: PATCH /clients/me
Ctrl -> Model : 15: update_client(db, user_id, data)
Model --> Ctrl : 16: ClientProfileRead
Ctrl --> UI : 17: ClientProfileRead
UI --> Cli : 18: perfil actualizado

@enduml